    "lines": [
      "Meta-Rational Pragmatics asks how we reason when no fixed system fits the situation.",
      "It approaches understanding as learning the distinctions an agent must preserve to act well.",
      "The book connects representation, interpretation, uncertainty, and action in one operational framework."
